"><span begin="03:42.736" end="03:43.007">Never</span><span begin="03:43.007" end="03:43.261">stop</span><span begin="03:43.261" end="03:43.715">reaching</span><span begin="03:43.715" end="03:43.984">for</span><span begin="03:43.984" end="03:44.168"></span><span begin="03:44.168" end="03:44.760">thesky</span></text><text for="L94"><span begin="03:44.667" end="03:44.992">Keep</span><span begin="03:44.992" end="03:45.504">chasing</span><span begin="03:45.504" end="03:45.654"></span><span begin="03:45.654" end="03:46.104">theshooting</span><span begin="03:46.104" end="03:46.567">star</span></text><text for="L95"><span begin="03:46.478" end="03:46.788"></span><span begin="03:46.788" end="03:46.974">Never</span><span begin="03:46.974" end="03:47.471">stopreaching</span><span begin="03:47.471" end="03:47.801">for</span><span begin="03:47.801" end="03:47.954"></span><span begin="03:47.954" end="03:48.681">thesky</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:53.631"><div begin="00:07.154" end="03:48.681"><p begin="00:07.154" end="00:11.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:07.154" end="00:07.634">暗</span><span begin="00:07.634" end="00:08.628">闇</span><span begin="00:08.628" end="00:09.090">が</span><span begin="00:09.090" end="00:09.818">深</span><span begin="00:09.818" end="00:10.200">く</span><span begin="00:10.316" end="00:10.732">な</span><span begin="00:10.732" end="00:10.929">る</span><span begin="00:10.929" end="00:11.217">ほ</span><span begin="00:11.217" end="00:11.693">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越是身处深沉的黑暗</span></p><p begin="00:14.654" end="00:19.262" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:14.654" end="00:15.648">輝</span><span begin="00:15.648" end="00:16.134">く</span><span begin="00:16.134" end="00:16.811">星</span><span begin="00:16.811" end="00:17.330">も</span><span begin="00:17.330" end="00:17.791">あ</span><span begin="00:17.791" end="00:18.256">る</span><span begin="00:18.256" end="00:18.479">だ</span><span begin="00:18.479" end="00:19.262">ろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越有星辰因此闪耀吧</span></p><p begin="00:22.753" end="00:24.206" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:22.753" end="00:23.056">人</span><span begin="00:23.056" end="00:23.166">の</span><span begin="00:23.166" end="00:23.337">目</span> <span begin="00:23.337" end="00:23.625">世</span><span begin="00:23.625" end="00:23.891">間</span><span begin="00:23.891" end="00:23.993">の</span><span begin="00:23.993" end="00:24.206">声</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他人的目光 世间的议论</span></p><p begin="00:24.206" end="00:26.382" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:24.206" end="00:24.518">もう</span><span begin="00:24.518" end="00:24.923">諦</span><span begin="00:24.923" end="00:25.158">める</span><span begin="00:25.158" end="00:25.302">理</span><span begin="00:25.302" end="00:25.515">由</span><span begin="00:25.515" end="00:25.909">だら</span><span begin="00:25.909" end="00:26.382">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经有太多足以让人放弃的理由</span></p><p begin="00:26.547" end="00:27.923" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:26.547" end="00:26.923">バテバ</span><span begin="00:26.923" end="00:27.371">テに</span><span begin="00:27.371" end="00:27.595">なっ</span><span begin="00:27.595" end="00:27.747">たっ</span><span begin="00:27.747" end="00:27.923">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使早已筋疲力尽</span></p><p begin="00:27.934" end="00:29.953" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:27.934" end="00:28.257">まだ</span><span begin="00:28.257" end="00:28.558">走</span><span begin="00:28.558" end="00:28.934">るのは</span><span begin="00:28.934" end="00:29.243">なんで</span><span begin="00:29.243" end="00:29.645">だっ</span><span begin="00:29.645" end="00:29.953">け？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却还是继续奔跑 究竟是为什么？</span></p><p begin="00:30.356" end="00:33.815" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:30.356" end="00:30.885">乾</span><span begin="00:30.885" end="00:31.128">く</span><span begin="00:31.128" end="00:31.563">間も</span><span begin="00:31.563" end="00:31.800">無</span><span begin="00:31.800" end="00:32.294">く</span><span begin="00:32.294" end="00:32.763">汗</span><span begin="00:32.763" end="00:32.982">が</span><span begin="00:32.982" end="00:33.481">踊</span><span begin="00:33.481" end="00:33.815">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">汗水还来不及干 就已随着舞步飞扬</span></p><p begin="00:33.950" end="00:36.985" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:33.950" end="00:34.676">流</span><span begin="00:34.676" end="00:35.134">れ</span><span begin="00:35.134" end="00:35.598">星</span><span begin="00:35.598" end="00:35.830">の</span><span begin="00:35.830" end="00:36.302">様</span><span begin="00:36.302" end="00:36.985">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如一颗流星</span></p><p begin="00:36.439" end="00:40.191" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:36.439" end="00:36.766">手</span><span begin="00:36.766" end="00:37.107">を</span><span begin="00:37.107" end="00:37.609">伸ば</span><span begin="00:37.609" end="00:38.414">せ</span><span begin="00:38.414" end="00:38.644">ば</span><span begin="00:38.644" end="00:39.582">遠</span><span begin="00:39.582" end="00:40.191">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸手去追 却发现它遥不可及</span></p><p begin="00:40.234" end="00:43.965" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:40.234" end="00:40.861">届</span><span begin="00:40.861" end="00:41.130">き</span><span begin="00:41.130" end="00:42.181">そう</span><span begin="00:42.181" end="00:42.386">も</span><span begin="00:42.386" end="00:43.090">ない</span><span begin="00:43.090" end="00:43.411">の</span><span begin="00:43.411" end="00:43.965">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明连触及它都像是不可能</span></p><p begin="00:44.014" end="00:46.913" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:44.014" end="00:44.249">不</span><span begin="00:44.249" end="00:44.617">可</span><span begin="00:44.617" end="00:44.897">能</span><span begin="00:44.897" end="00:45.559">すら</span><span begin="00:45.559" end="00:45.946">も</span><span begin="00:45.946" end="00:46.377">愛</span><span begin="00:46.377" end="00:46.913">しい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可就连这份不可能 也让人心生眷恋</span></p><p begin="00:47.044" end="00:48.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:47.044" end="00:47.789">笑</span><span begin="00:47.789" end="00:48.005">え</span><span begin="00:48.005" end="00:48.280">ば</span><span begin="00:48.280" end="00:48.882">いい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管笑吧 我这就向你奔赴而来</span></p><p begin="00:49.113" end="00:52.196" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:49.113" end="00:49.602">今</span><span begin="00:49.602" end="00:50.359">そこに</span><span begin="00:50.359" end="00:50.607">行</span><span begin="00:50.607" end="00:52.196">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就向目标前进</span></p><p begin="00:51.653" end="00:53.676" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:51.653" end="00:52.224">何回</span><span begin="00:52.224" end="00:52.477">だっ</span><span begin="00:52.477" end="00:52.682">て</span> <span begin="00:52.682" end="00:53.051">Do-</span><span begin="00:53.051" end="00:53.354">Dat-</span><span begin="00:53.354" end="00:53.676">Dat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论多少次 都要继续前进</span></p><p begin="00:53.572" end="00:56.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:53.572" end="00:54.084">果て</span><span begin="00:54.084" end="00:54.561">まで</span> <span begin="00:54.561" end="00:54.937">Do-</span><span begin="00:54.937" end="00:55.236">rat-</span><span begin="00:55.236" end="00:55.534">tat-</span><span begin="00:55.534" end="00:56.250">tat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至尽头 也绝不退缩</span></p><p begin="00:55.894" end="00:59.347" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:55.894" end="00:56.202">Can</span> <span begin="00:56.202" end="00:56.389">you</span> <span begin="00:56.389" end="00:56.908">fly</span> <span begin="00:56.908" end="00:57.365">with</span> <span begin="00:57.365" end="00:57.632">me</span> <span begin="00:57.632" end="00:57.862">to</span> <span begin="00:57.862" end="00:58.097">the</span> <span begin="00:58.097" end="00:59.347">moon?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你愿意和我一起飞向月球吗？</span></p><p begin="00:59.202" end="01:01.229" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:59.202" end="00:59.751">簡単</span><span begin="00:59.751" end="00:59.946">だっ</span><span begin="00:59.946" end="01:00.178">て</span> <span begin="01:00.178" end="01:00.546">Do-</span><span begin="01:00.546" end="01:00.848">Dat-</span><span begin="01:00.848" end="01:01.229">Dat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实并没有那么难</span></p><p begin="01:00.979" end="01:03.512" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:00.979" end="01:01.372">さぁ</span><span begin="01:01.372" end="01:01.762">描</span><span begin="01:01.762" end="01:02.072">いて</span> <span begin="01:02.072" end="01:02.426">Do-</span><span begin="01:02.426" end="01:02.754">rat-</span><span begin="01:02.754" end="01:03.002">tat-</span><span begin="01:03.002" end="01:03.512">tat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 尽情描绘心中的梦想</span></p><p begin="01:03.400" end="01:06.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:03.400" end="01:03.708">Can</span> <span begin="01:03.708" end="01:03.888">you</span> <span begin="01:03.888" end="01:04.407">fly</span> <span begin="01:04.407" end="01:04.890">with</span> <span begin="01:04.890" end="01:05.120">me</span> <span begin="01:05.120" end="01:05.352">to</span> <span begin="01:05.352" end="01:05.570">the</span> <span begin="01:05.570" end="01:06.520">moon?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你愿意和我一起飞向月球吗？</span></p><p begin="01:06.488" end="01:07.769" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:06.488" end="01:07.198">飛び出</span><span begin="01:07.198" end="01:07.769">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵身启程吧</span></p><p begin="01:07.773" end="01:09.707" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:07.773" end="01:08.158">Shine</span> <span begin="01:08.158" end="01:08.433">like</span> <span begin="01:08.433" end="01:08.564">a</span> <span begin="01:08.564" end="01:09.265">shooting</span> <span begin="01:09.265" end="01:09.707">star</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像流星一样闪耀</span></p><p begin="01:09.773" end="01:11.555" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:09.773" end="01:10.072">もう</span><span begin="01:10.072" end="01:10.256">待っ</span><span begin="01:10.256" end="01:10.530">てい</span><span begin="01:10.530" end="01:10.917">ら</span><span begin="01:10.917" end="01:11.227">れ</span><span begin="01:11.227" end="01:11.555">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经等不及了</span></p><p begin="01:11.555" end="01:13.451" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:11.555" end="01:11.923">Shine</span> <span begin="01:11.923" end="01:12.163">like</span> <span begin="01:12.163" end="01:12.307">a</span> <span begin="01:12.307" end="01:12.998">shooting</span> <span begin="01:12.998" end="01:13.451">star</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像流星一样闪耀</span></p><p begin="01:13.227" end="01:16.134" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:13.227" end="01:13.803">Fly</span> <span begin="01:13.803" end="01:14.205">with</span> <span begin="01:14.205" end="01:14.483">me</span> <span begin="01:14.483" end="01:14.728">to</span> <span begin="01:14.728" end="01:14.965">the</span> <span begin="01:14.965" end="01:16.134">moon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和我一起飞向月球</span></p><p begin="01:15.368" end="01:17.169" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:15.368" end="01:15.657">No</span> <span begin="01:15.657" end="01:16.083">matter</span> <span begin="01:16.083" end="01:16.457">who</span> <span begin="01:16.457" end="01:16.838">you</span> <span begin="01:16.838" end="01:17.169">are</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论你是谁</span></p><p begin="01:17.245" end="01:19.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:17.245" end="01:17.542">Light</span> <span begin="01:17.542" end="01:17.713">up</span> <span begin="01:17.713" end="01:17.929">the</span> <span begin="01:17.929" end="01:18.289">world</span> <span begin="01:18.289" end="01:18.652">so</span> <span begin="01:18.652" end="01:19.021">far</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">照亮远方的世界</span></p><p begin="01:19.060" end="01:20.994" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:19.060" end="01:19.421">Shine</span> <span begin="01:19.421" end="01:19.650">like</span> <span begin="01:19.650" end="01:19.802">a</span> <span begin="01:19.802" end="01:20.509">shooting</span> <span begin="01:20.509" end="01:20.994">star</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像流星一样闪耀</span></p><p begin="01:20.694" end="01:24.174" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:20.694" end="01:21.279">Fly</span> <span begin="01:21.279" end="01:21.702">with</span> <span begin="01:21.702" end="01:21.993">me</span> <span begin="01:21.993" end="01:22.235">to</span> <span begin="01:22.235" end="01:22.457">the</span> <span begin="01:22.457" end="01:24.174">moon</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和我一起飞向月球</span></p><p begin="01:29.457" end="01:30.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:29.457" end="01:29.740">まだ</span><span begin="01:29.740" end="01:29.932">道</span><span begin="01:29.932" end="01:30.068">の</span><span begin="01:30.068" end="01:30.178">途</span><span begin="01:30.178" end="01:30.654">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们仍走在半途</span></p><p begin="01:30.564" end="01:31.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:30.564" end="01:30.954">いつか</span><span begin="01:30.954" end="01:31.162">届</span><span begin="01:31.162" end="01:31.463">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总有一天会抵达的心愿 已在空中翩然起舞</span></p><p begin="01:31.473" end="01:33.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:31.473" end="01:31.898">想</span><span begin="01:31.898" end="01:32.101">いは</span><span begin="01:32.101" end="01:32.335">宙</span><span begin="01:32.335" end="01:32.464">に</span><span begin="01:32.464" end="01:32.698">舞っ</span><span begin="01:32.698" end="01:32.943">た-</span><span begin="01:32.943" end="01:33.177">tat</span></p><p begin="01:33.177" end="01:34.612" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:33.177" end="01:33.399">皆</span><span begin="01:33.399" end="01:33.530">に</span><span begin="01:33.530" end="01:33.671">とっ</span><span begin="01:33.671" end="01:33.856">ての</span><span begin="01:33.856" end="01:33.956">普</span><span begin="01:33.956" end="01:34.223">通</span><span begin="01:34.223" end="01:34.612">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对所有人而言理所当然的日常</span></p><p begin="01:34.244" end="01:35.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:34.244" end="01:34.549">少</span><span begin="01:34.549" end="01:34.649">し</span><span begin="01:34.649" end="01:34.802">窮</span><span begin="01:34.802" end="01:35.231">屈</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却让我觉得有些压抑</span></p><p begin="01:35.124" end="01:37.876" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="01:35.124" end="01:35.354">まだ</span><span begin="01:35.354" end="01:35.740">信号は</span><span begin="01:35.740" end="01:36.073">ブルー</span><span begin="01:36.073" end="01:36.207">に</span><span begin="01:36.207" end="01:36.450">光っ</span><span begin="01:36.450" end="01:36.674">た</span><span begin="01:36.674" end="01:36.992">まんま</span><span begin="01:36.992" end="01:37.211">待っ</span><span begin="01:37.211" end="01:37.624">たなし</span><span begin="01:37.624" end="01:37.876">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">信号灯依然亮着绿灯</span></p><p begin="01:37.927" end="01:39.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="01:37.927" end="01:38.345">あれも</span><span begin="01:38.345" end="01:38.684">したいし</span><span begin="01:38.684" end="01:39.030">これも</span><span begin="01:39.030" end="01:39.340">したい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经没有时间再等了</span></p><p begin="01:39.340" end="01:41.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="01:39.340" end="01:39.630">息</span><span begin="01:39.630" end="01:39.827">苦</span><span begin="01:39.827" end="01:39.971">しい</span><span begin="01:39.971" end="01:40.291">時代の</span><span begin="01:40.291" end="01:40.549">せいに</span><span begin="01:40.549" end="01:41.017">なんかし</span><span begin="01:41.017" end="01:41.353">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我才不会把这一切</span></p><p begin="01:41.662" end="01:43.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="01:41.662" end="01:41.947">バック</span><span begin="01:41.947" end="01:42.278">パックに</span><span begin="01:42.278" end="01:42.502">パン</span><span begin="01:42.502" end="01:42.798">パン</span><span begin="01:42.798" end="01:42.912">の</span><span begin="01:42.912" end="01:43.232">希望や</span><span begin="01:43.232" end="01:43.609">未来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">归咎于这个令人窒息的时代</span></p><p begin="01:43.491" end="01:45.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="01:43.491" end="01:43.770">飽きる</span><span begin="01:43.770" end="01:44.037">ほど</span><span begin="01:44.037" end="01:44.283">人生</span><span begin="01:44.283" end="01:44.496">楽</span><span begin="01:44.496" end="01:44.744">しみ</span><span begin="01:44.744" end="01:45.310">たい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是希望与未来</span></p><p begin="01:45.397" end="01:46.746" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="01:45.397" end="01:45.700">わ</span><span begin="01:45.700" end="01:45.911">かっ</span><span begin="01:45.911" end="01:46.127">てる</span><span begin="01:46.127" end="01:46.346">楽</span><span begin="01:46.346" end="01:46.746">じゃない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我明白 这一切并不轻松</span></p><p begin="01:46.746" end="01:48.578" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="01:46.746" end="01:46.994">不</span><span begin="01:46.994" end="01:47.229">安</span><span begin="01:47.229" end="01:47.341">に</span><span begin="01:47.341" end="01:47.704">揺れて</span><span begin="01:47.704" end="01:47.901">まだ</span><span begin="01:47.901" end="01:48.207">綱</span><span begin="01:48.207" end="01:48.578">渡り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍在不安中摇摆 如同走钢丝一般</span></p><p begin="01:48.578" end="01:49.065" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="01:48.578" end="01:48.823">Aye</span> <span begin="01:48.823" end="01:49.065">aye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我还是觉得「这样也不错」</span></p><p begin="01:49.065" end="01:50.457" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="01:49.065" end="01:49.340">でも</span><span begin="01:49.340" end="01:49.868">思えてる</span><span begin="01:49.868" end="01:50.113">「悪</span><span begin="01:50.113" end="01:50.457">くない」</span></p><p begin="01:50.457" end="01:52.396" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="01:50.457" end="01:50.935">なんなら</span><span begin="01:50.935" end="01:51.420">スキップ</span> <span begin="01:51.420" end="01:51.993">鼻歌</span><span begin="01:51.993" end="01:52.396">歌い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至还能迈着轻快的步子 哼着歌</span></p><p begin="01:52.335" end="01:52.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="01:52.335" end="01:52.610">Aye</span> <span begin="01:52.610" end="01:52.884">aye</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你问我正朝着哪里前进？</span></p><p begin="01:53.146" end="01:54.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="01:53.146" end="01:53.631">どこに</span><span begin="01:53.631" end="01:53.965">向かっ</span><span begin="01:53.965" end="01:54.130">て</span><span begin="01:54.130" end="01:54.393">るっ</span><span begin="01:54.393" end="01:54.783">て？</span></p><p begin="01:55.003" end="01:56.590" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="01:55.003" end="01:55.527">考</span><span begin="01:55.527" end="01:55.687">え</span><span begin="01:55.687" end="01:55.850">中</span><span begin="01:55.850" end="01:55.983">さ</span> <span begin="01:55.983" end="01:56.216">うる</span><span begin="01:56.216" end="01:56.590">せぇ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还在想呢 少管我</span></p><p begin="01:56.858" end="01:58.313" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="01:56.858" end="01:57.350">Hey!</span> <span begin="01:57.350" end="01:57.689">Don't</span> <span begin="01:57.689" end="01:57.887">stop</span> <span begin="01:57.887" end="01:58.100">your</span> <span begin="01:58.100" end="01:58.313">step</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿 别停下你的脚步</span></p><p begin="01:58.313" end="01:59.292" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="01:58.313" end="01:58.620">遊</span><span begin="01:58.620" end="01:58.745">び</span><span begin="01:58.745" end="01:58.964">尽</span><span begin="01:58.964" end="01:59.292">くせ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情享受这一切吧</span></p><p begin="01:59.247" end="02:02.737" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="01:59.247" end="01:59.659">ゴー</span><span begin="01:59.659" end="02:00.006">ル</span><span begin="02:00.006" end="02:00.204">は</span><span begin="02:00.204" end="02:00.945">す</span><span begin="02:00.945" end="02:01.099">ぐ</span><span begin="02:01.099" end="02:01.852">そ</span><span begin="02:01.852" end="02:02.126">こ</span><span begin="02:02.126" end="02:02.737">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终点就在不远处</span></p><p begin="02:02.785" end="02:06.836" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="02:02.785" end="02:03.015">もう</span><span begin="02:03.015" end="02:03.706">届</span><span begin="02:03.706" end="02:03.874">き</span><span begin="02:03.874" end="02:04.858">そう</span><span begin="02:04.858" end="02:05.562">な</span><span begin="02:05.562" end="02:05.828">の</span><span begin="02:05.828" end="02:06.836">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明已经近在咫尺</span></p><p begin="02:06.738" end="02:09.434" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51"><span begin="02:06.738" end="02:07.144">無</span><span begin="02:07.144" end="02:07.626">愛</span><span begin="02:07.626" end="02:08.034">想</span><span begin="02:08.034" end="02:08.405">な</span><span begin="02:08.405" end="02:08.650">女</span><span begin="02:08.650" end="02:09.434">神</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那位冷若冰霜的女神</span></p><p begin="02:09.564" end="02:11.415" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52"><span begin="02:09.564" end="02:10.299">笑</span><span begin="02:10.299" end="02:10.465">わ</span><span begin="02:10.465" end="02:10.800">せ</span><span begin="02:10.800" end="02:11.415">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我这就过去 让她也展露笑容</span></p><p begin="02:11.473" end="02:14.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53"><span begin="02:11.473" end="02:11.918">す</span><span begin="02:11.918" end="02:12.128">ぐ</span><span begin="02:12.128" end="02:12.879">そこに</span><span begin="02:12.879" end="02:13.146">行</span><span begin="02:13.146" end="02:14.337">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就启程出发</span></p><p begin="02:14.189" end="02:16.212" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54"><span begin="02:14.189" end="02:14.760">何回</span><span begin="02:14.760" end="02:15.013">だっ</span><span begin="02:15.013" end="02:15.218">て</span> <span begin="02:15.218" end="02:15.587">Do-</span><span begin="02:15.587" end="02:15.890">Dat-</span><span begin="02:15.890" end="02:16.212">Dat</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论多少次 都要继续前进</span></p><p begin="02:16.046" end="02:18.676" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55"><span begin="02:16.046" end="02:16.558">果て</span><span begin="02:16.558" end="02:17.035">